                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "57202e4c-4f34-30b3-b16c-347a88e7c1d4",
                        "entry_id": "a6f440be-8b39-374e-9168-af908fdd8835",
                        "glosses": [
                            "углубление в себя, в свои мысли, переживания"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0657203f-4d30-4a57-b552-d7c7ba8e1873",
                                "sense_id": "57202e4c-4f34-30b3-b16c-347a88e7c1d4",
                                "text": "Мистическое самоуглубление, как и расширение научного или оккультного познания, само в себе также не содержит ключа к религиозному постижению мира, — и оно нуждается в религиозных аксиомах откровения, лишь чрез них живым светом загораются его богатства."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d26c1264-5f3e-4cf8-ab0a-a5fbb05edb35",
                                "sense_id": "57202e4c-4f34-30b3-b16c-347a88e7c1d4",
                                "text": "Я походил по комнате, решил, что подобное самоуглубление, когда пришёл друг, – слишком даже для современного писателя."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b8836abb-b436-387e-bdd5-8185fd54e595",
                        "entry_id": "a6f440be-8b39-374e-9168-af908fdd8835",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спец. прорастание вглубь без воздействия извне (о растениях)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "132c5095-0f25-4f2b-8f89-874aa27731fd",
                        "source_entry_id": "a6f440be-8b39-374e-9168-af908fdd8835",
                        "target_lang_word": "introspection",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "introspection",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7568e244-8cda-32d9-b34c-977b94788d45",
                                        "entry_id": "cb5b06ed-7620-3dd1-b649-dc3e809cf45a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A looking inward; specifically, the act or process of self-examination, or inspection of one's own thoughts and feelings; the cognition which the mind has of its own acts and states."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f82506bc-56ab-4e76-a1ea-60ec89bb55a4",
                                                "sense_id": "7568e244-8cda-32d9-b34c-977b94788d45",
                                                "text": "If Adam Wheeler gave it some thought, or if someone were to prompt him with the right questions, he could put words around the fact that his existence doesn't bring him any satisfaction. He would discover, on introspection, that he's nowhere close, actually, to \"happy\", and that there is something vast and significant missing from his life. But he doesn't give it any thought. There's a void between him and those questions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a54d41fe-4a8d-3e0a-8e3c-5f2891b54afe",
                                        "entry_id": "cb5b06ed-7620-3dd1-b649-dc3e809cf45a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Clipping of type introspection."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "clipping",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4c8b46f6-85a2-4b6d-902f-3d6ba30b9143",
                        "source_entry_id": "a6f440be-8b39-374e-9168-af908fdd8835",
                        "target_lang_word": "delving",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "delving",
